B.kr=s(["Apnoea/gasping, poor effort or shock: Stabilize immediately; ventilate when indicated","Maintain TABC; provide warmth; admit to SNCU/NICU","Attach pulse oximeter; monitor HR, RR, SpO\u2082 and CRT; assess SAS","Feed when stable: breastfeed if mild RD; OG feeds when appropriate on CPAP; decompress stomach","Withhold feeds; give IV fluids for severe RD, recurrent apnoea, poor perfusion or abdominal concerns"],t.s)
B.a_M=new A.aR(B.eE,B.ao,u.gD,B.kr,B.n)
B.ad9=s(["Maintain TABC.",u.cC,"Check blood glucose; send CBC and electrolytes.","If sepsis is likely, draw blood culture and give the first antibiotic dose without delay.",u.eM,"Manage shock, dehydration and seizures."],t.s)
