B.a1z=new A.bV("rd_mcq_8","When gestational age (GA) is uncertain, what operational surrogate birth weight (BW) cutoff may be used to guide management in the STW algorithm?",B.aa4,2,'The algorithm explicitly notes: "If GA is uncertain, BW \u22641800 g may be used as an operational surrogate" to decide eligibility for CPAP and caffeine therapy.',"Uncertain gestational age",null,'ICMR/DHR STW "Respiratory Distress in Neonates" (August 2026), START CPAP; MCQs RD.docx Section 1 Q8')
